# GMS casts a fog that lasts a few seconds and ticks 120+6x% inside it, over a
# 190+4x% hit as it lands.
#
# The duration is ours. GMS's fog outlives its cast by a few seconds and can be
# re-laid over itself; here a mark rides the monster, so the fog becomes a burn
# that is simply relit. Nine and a half seconds up to twenty-one, which is long
# enough that the chooser walks away and comes back rather than spending every
# swing on it.
#
# Six enemies against the pool's ten: GMS caps neither, and what separates them
# is that one is a fog you stand in and the other spreads down the platform.
name: "Poison Mist"
skill_order: 2
description:
  "Creates a poisonous fog around you, dealing poison damage to all enemies "
  "nearby on its own."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_FIRE_POISON_MAGE
max_level: 20
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
max_enemies: 6
base_delay_ms: 660
base { skill_pct: 1.94 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.04 }
dot {
  interval_seconds: 1.0
  duration_seconds: 9.6
  duration_seconds_per_level: 0.6
  lines: 1
  base { skill_pct: 1.26 }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.06 }
}
